# Whitelist. Tracked: source code, aggregate results (metrics, CIs, cluster summaries), logs, manuscript, redacted notes.
# Never tracked (must stay in SPC AWS): raw GENIE BPC, patient-level derived tables (events, landmarks, labels, genomics
# status, splits), per-landmark predictions, embeddings, model weights.
*
!*/
!*.py
!*.sh
!jobs_*.txt
!dashboard_assets/*.css
!README.md
!LICENSE-delphi
!.gitignore
!manuscript.md
!docs/*.md
!results*.csv
!paired_*.csv
!biology_results.csv
!gbsa_ref_random5.csv
!top_genes.csv
!results_final/*.csv
!results_final/*.log
!*.log
pip.log
dashboard.log
# original notes name AWS buckets/account: redacted copies live in docs/
/PLAN.md
/HANDOFF.md
runs/
figs/
